SECTION 4 — TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE RECOMMENDATION
Merge Strategy
Use Platform 1 (SAAS/) as the main foundation and migrate key features from Platform 2 (ecommerce/).
Rationale: Platform 1 is on Laravel 12 (3 versions ahead), uses Vue 3 vs EOL Vue 2, has proper multi-tenancy in the DB schema, and has 66 migrations vs 4. Multi-tenancy is the hardest thing to retrofit — since it already exists in Platform 1, this is the correct starting point.

