Risk	Severity	Mitigation
Vue 2 → Vue 3 migration of Platform 2 Blade components	High	Don't migrate Blade — rebuild storefront in Vue 3 using Platform 2 as functional spec
RBAC conflict (Entrust vs Spatie)	High	Adopt Spatie/permission; rewrite permission seeder
Database schema merge (different table names)	High	Audit both schemas; write fresh unified migrations
Multi-tenancy not in Platform 2	High	Apply CompanyScope pattern to all migrated Platform 2 features
JWT vs Sanctum guard split	Medium	JWT for admin/staff API; Sanctum for customer/seller/delivery API
Payment gateway duplication (6 + 20+)	Medium	Audit overlap, standardize on Platform 2 implementations
Laravel 10 → 12 upgrade for Platform 2 code	Medium	Run upgrade checks and fix deprecations before porting
Helper-heavy code from Platform 2	Medium	Refactor to Services + Repositories pattern before merging

